<title>KENYA: Kenya rustling clash kills 27.</title>
<headline>Kenya rustling clash kills 27.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty two cattle rustlers, four police home guards and one civilian were killed in a clash in Samburu, northern Kenya, Kenya television reported on Sunday.</p>
<p>The television said the heavily-armed rustlers stole cattle and goats from villagers near Kwapu, Samburu district, on Saturday night and ambushed the home guards who were pursuing them.</p>
<p>One hundred and fifty cattle and 1,000 goats were later recovered. Police are pursuing the surviving raiders.</p>
</text>
